    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Borders\r\n\r\nNotice that there is a new section of our webpage called `<style>`. This defines the rules for how the webpage should look.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Ask AI Tutor to explain how the `border`property works in CSS.\r\n2. Ask AI Tutor to update each `<section>` on this page with a different style.\r\n   - Use the property name in your prompt (e.g., *\"Set the `border` to...\"*).\r\n\r\nOnce you've styled the page, click **Continue**.",
